 32	Local model entries are stored lazily by canonical model name and verbose flag,
 33	with the manifest digest recorded in the entry. The manifest digest is the
 34	freshness boundary: if the model content changes, the digest changes, so the
 35	previous response is replaced instead of accumulating under an old digest key.
 36	Requests with System or Options overlays bypass the cache because those overlays
 37	mutate the effective show response.
